  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Returning Refugees and Internally Displaced Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project, IOM will aim at the improvement of living conditions and future perspectives of the people in Afghanistan. The proposed project contributes directly to the improvement of living conditions of refugees, internal displaced and returnees (displaced people) by fostering reintegration, stabilization and resilience through recovery and transition activities and offers support to provincial capitals of Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
